 AWS Europe (Frankfurt) region, alongside investments in logistics, jobs, and media production. Investors will assess whether AWS momentum and AI demand can sustain growth while delivering adequate returns on rising infrastructure spending."]},{"type":"p","children":["Wall Street rates the stock a Strong Buy, a view shared by Seeking Alpha's Quant rating system."]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Consensus EPS Estimate:"]}," $1.96"]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Consensus Revenue Estimate:"]}," $202.20B"]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Earnings Insight:"]}," Amazon has beaten revenue estimates in a consecutive straight 8 quarters and missed EPS estimates just once in those reports."]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Also reporting"]},": Intel ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:INTC","text":"NASDAQ:INTC"}},", Altria Group ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:MO","text":"NYSE:MO"}},", Gilead Sciences ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:GILD","text":"NASDAQ:GILD"}},", Starbucks ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:SBUX","text":"NASDAQ:SBUX"}},", Merck ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:MRK","text":"NYSE:MRK"}},", Bristol-Myers Squibb ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:BMY","text":"NYSE:BMY"}},", Enterprise Products Partners L.P. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:EPD","text":"NYSE:EPD"}},", Mastercard ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:MA","text":"NYSE:MA"}},", Caterpillar ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:CAT","text":"NYSE:CAT"}},", Shell ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:SHEL","text":"NYSE:SHEL"}},", Twilio ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:TWLO","text":"NYSE:TWLO"}},", Coinbase Global ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:COIN","text":"NASDAQ:COIN"}},", Pinterest ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:PINS","text":"NYSE:PINS"}},", Roblox ",{"type":"sym